# Kotlin Rules

Use idiomatic Kotlin.

## Prefer

- data class
- sealed class
- object
- extension functions
- scope functions when appropriate

## Coroutines

Use

- viewModelScope
- lifecycleScope

Use Dispatchers.IO for

- database
- network
- file operations

Never block Main thread.

Never use GlobalScope.

## Naming

Use meaningful names.

Functions should

- do one thing
- remain small
- be self-documenting

Avoid magic numbers.

Prefer constants.

Prefer immutable collections.